From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opi5 <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: rockchip: hook MPP and multi-RGA into Kbuild

Appended to the end of each file so Armbian patches that add entries
above them don't conflict. rga3/ is a subdirectory of rga/ and is
reached from rga/'s Makefile: listed in rockchip/'s as rga/rga3/, a
single-module build (make .../rga3/rga3.ko) also descended into rga/
with the goal rga3/rga3.o, which linked rga3.o from itself in parallel
with the real link ("input file is the same as output file").
---
 drivers/media/platform/rockchip/Kconfig      | 2 ++
 drivers/media/platform/rockchip/Makefile     | 1 +
 drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/Makefile | 1 +
 3 files changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/Kconfig b/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/Kconfig
index 6f8d6bee250f..e6ed2e0cffbe 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/Kconfig
@@ -6,3 +6,5 @@ source "drivers/media/platform/rockchip/iep/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rkisp1/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rkvdec/Kconfig"
+source "drivers/media/platform/rockchip/mpp/Kconfig"
+source "drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/rga3/Kconfig"
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/Makefile b/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/Makefile
index fc9110004158..cfd33d5edc41 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/Makefile
@@ -3,3 +3,4 @@ obj-y += iep/
 obj-y += rga/
 obj-y += rkisp1/
 obj-y += rkvdec/
+obj-y += mpp/
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/Makefile b/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/Makefile
index 1bbecdc3d8df..5e34ada30644 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/Makefile
@@ -2,3 +2,4 @@
 rockchip-rga-objs := rga.o rga-hw.o rga-buf.o
 
 obj-$(CONFIG_VIDEO_ROCKCHIP_RGA) += rockchip-rga.o
+obj-y += rga3/
